  "releaseNotes": "⭐ Last 10 features:\n- feat: Inline array support and deepObject serialization for object query params 2026-03-22\n- feat: Extract inline object schemas from bindings and skip object-type query params 2026-03-21\n- feat: Extract inline enum schemas from bindings.ws.query to components 2026-03-21\n- feat: Support inline schemas in bindings.ws.query + snapshot test 2026-03-21\n- feat: Generate typed ConnectAsync with query params from AsyncAPI channel bindings 2026-03-21\n- feat: Native upstream AsyncAPI spec support — inline payloads, per-channel servers, operationTraits 2026-03-21\n- feat: Add const discriminator support for AsyncAPI specs 2026-03-21\n- feat: Add unit tests for DeriveNameFromMethodAndPath and strip more version prefixes 2026-03-21\n- feat: Derive request/response type names from method+path when operationId is missing (#181) 2026-03-21\n- feat: Support multi-channel AsyncAPI specs (#183) 2026-03-21\n🐞 Last 10 bug fixes:\n- fix: relax generic allof validation 2026-03-26\n- fix: add deterministic ordering to dictionary iterations in code generation 2026-03-23\n- fix: Suppress empty convenience overloads for discriminator base classes (#161) 2026-03-21\n- feat: Extract inline enum schemas from bindings.ws.query to components 2026-03-21\n- feat: Support inline schemas in bindings.ws.query + snapshot test 2026-03-21\n- fix: Namespace-prefix OneOf file names and case-insensitive property dedup 2026-03-21\n- fix: Use CSharpTypeNullability for all remaining ?. operator usages 2026-03-21\n- feat: Native upstream AsyncAPI spec support — inline payloads, per-channel servers, operationTraits 2026-03-21\n- fix: Use CSharpTypeNullability for AnyOf ?. operator too 2026-03-21\n- fix: Use CSharpTypeNullability instead of IsRequired for enum ?. operator (#179) 2026-03-21",
